+// Hegel zoo: the PyYAML oracle bridge, the canonical value form shared with it, a deep
+// equality for the values js-yaml loads and dumps, the shapes the properties count, and the
+// generators of the dump-side properties: JavaScript values built from Hegel's combinators
+// (strings that look like something else to a YAML resolver, numbers at the edges, Dates,
+// bytes, Sets, Maps, shared and cyclic objects, nested three collections deep) and the
+// presenter options of js-yaml and PyYAML as records of optional fields.
