+/** A Date: a day of 1970-2030 at midnight (17%) or to the millisecond (17), the first of January of year 1-999 (17), anywhere within about 317 years of the epoch (16), one of `edges` (16), or a day of 1900-2100 whose day of month may run over into the next month (17). */
